Subject: LCLint Version 1.4 Now Available for linux
Message-ID: <ann-1172.782408390@cs.cornell.edu>
Followup-To: comp.os.linux.misc
Keywords: lclint, programming utility
Sender: mdw@cs.cornell.edu (Matt Welsh)
