Subject: Umsdos 0.5: Put your helmet on :-)
Message-ID: <ann-18499.783618523@cs.cornell.edu>
Followup-To: comp.os.linux.misc
Keywords: Umsdos 0.5 Optimisation upload file system
Sender: mdw@cs.cornell.edu (Matt Welsh)
